        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Pokémon on the user’s side of the field are immune to stat-lowering effects for five turns.\n\nGuard Swap, Heart Swap, and Power Swap may still be used.\n\nDefog used by an opponent will end this effect.",
